on shows a classic mesioangular impaction at 38. The upper right crop (18 region) missed \u2014 mostly tuberosity bone, tooth not in frame, so 18 sits more mesial/inferior than my shift. The lower right crop shows a tilted molar but I need to distinguish 47 from 48 there. Let me re-derive the 18 region, and shift to the 47 and 37 regions to check for caries, plus locate 14 as an anchor for the undetected 15.\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"tool\": \"nudge_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [737.6, 183.2, 166.7, 351.9], \"dx_frac\": -0.5, \"dy_frac\": 0.34, \"scale\": 1}}, {\"tool\": \"nudge_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [929.8, 788.4, 240.3, 376.5], \"dx_frac\": -0.7, \"scale\": 1}}, {\"tool\": \"nudge_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [1725.4, 733.6, 245.5, 375.2], \"dx_frac\": 0.7, \"scale\": 1}}, {\"tool\": \"locate_tooth\", \"args\": {\"tooth\": 14}}]}"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Result of nudge_crop: {\"bbox\": [654.2, 302.8, 166.7, 351.9], \"note\": \"Call zoom_crop with this bbox to view the adjusted region.\"}"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of nudge_crop: {\"bbox\": [761.6, 788.4, 240.3, 376.5], \"note\": \"Call zoom_crop with this bbox to view the adjusted region.\"}"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of nudge_crop: {\"bbox\": [1897.2, 733.6, 245.5, 375.2], \"note\": \"Call zoom_crop with this bbox to view the adjusted region.\"}"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of locate_tooth: {\"tooth\": 14, \"confidence\": 0.608, \"bbox\": [1141.4, 282.9, 125.7, 404.6]}"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"thought\": \"14 located at [1141.4, 282.9, 125.7, 404.6] \u2014 15 should be just distal to it. Zooming into the corrected 18 region, the 47 region, the 37 region, and the 15 region (shifted distally from 14).\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"tool\": \"zoom_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [654.2, 302.8, 166.7, 351.9]}}, {\"tool\": \"zoom_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [761.6, 788.4, 240.3, 376.5]}}, {\"tool\": \"zoom_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [1897.2, 733.6, 245.5, 375.2]}}, {\"tool\": \"nudge_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [1141.4, 282.9, 125.7, 404.6], \"dx_frac\": 1.0, \"scale\": 1}}]}"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Earlier tool result omitted to save context \u2014 already reasoned about above]"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of zoom_crop:"}, {"type": "text", "text": "[Earlier tool result omitted to save context \u2014 already reasoned about above]"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of zoom_crop:"}, {"type": "text", "text": "[Earlier tool result omitted to save context \u2014 already reasoned about above]"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of zoom_crop:"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of nudge_crop: {\"bbox\": [1267.1, 282.9, 125.7, 404.6], \"note\": \"Call zoom_crop with this bbox to view the adjusted region.\"}"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"thought\": \"Key observations: the 47-region crop shows 47 with a large radiopaque restoration and possible shadowing beneath it; the 37-region crop clearly shows a mesioangular impacted 38 distal to 37, and 37 itself has a suspicious dark shadow at its distal occlusal surface. The 18-region crop shows a tilted crown at the right edge \u2014 likely 18 but not centered. Next: zoom the 15 region, tighten on 47 and 37 crowns, and locate 34 as an anchor toward 33.\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"tool\": \"zoom_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [1267.1, 282.9, 125.7, 404.6]}}, {\"tool\": \"nudge_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [761.6, 788.4, 240.3, 376.5], \"dx_frac\": -0.35, \"dy_frac\": -0.3, \"scale\": 0.55}}, {\"tool\": \"nudge_crop\", \"args\": {\"bbox\": [1897.2, 733.6, 245.5, 375.2], \"dx_frac\": 0.1, \"dy_frac\": -0.25, \"scale\": 0.6}}, {\"tool\": \"locate_tooth\", \"args\": {\"tooth\": 34}}]}"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Earlier tool result omitted to save context \u2014 already reasoned about above]"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of zoom_crop:"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Result of nudge_crop: {\"bbox\": 